    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dryness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				335d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.11
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ξ. τῶν νεῶν</span> the
				<i>dryness,</i> i.e. <i>soundness,</i> of their timbers,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.687f
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drying</i> or <i>becoming dry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τάχος τῆς ξ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					361b22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., of
			character, <i>austerity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Acad. Ind.</u>
				p.51
			</span></i> M. ; of style, <i>aridity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				3.3
			</span></i>.</div>
